This public edition extracts the manual geometry, validation and report
components from a larger private application. Automatic photo extraction,
personal calibration and reference banks are omitted. The landmark adapter
was removed and a newly authored synthetic demonstration was added.

No photographs, facial datasets, model weights, reference-bank records or
personal measurements are distributed. Demo coordinates are fictional
schematic fixtures authored for this edition, not measurements of a person.
